> register_injection "AuthApiService"

Add the following to your injection module:
```dart
@module
abstract class ApiModule {
  @lazySingleton
  AuthApiService provideAuthApiService(Dio dio) => AuthApiService(dio);
}
```

Also ensure the API is included in your `injection.dart` build method if needed.